1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,900
"I'll never understand that boy.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:05,840
"But then again,
I'm a religious nut,

3
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:09,940
(Sheldon:)and my mind is closed
to so many things."

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,110
"Spock to Enterprise.
Transport successful."

5
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:19,380
"Glory be to Heaven,

6
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:23,090
"some sort of creature
just manifested out of thin air.

7
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:25,520
"George, put down that Pepsi can
full of bourbon

8
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:28,790
(Sheldon:)that ain't foolin' no one,
and get your shotgun!"

9
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:31,050
"Greetings, Mary Cooper.

10
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:33,300
I am Spock."

11
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:38,050
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.
I just don't buy it.

12
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:41,140
(Penny:)Just keep going!

13
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:46,440
"Oh, my, your sudden appearance
startles me."

14
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:48,280
"We have been monitoring
your son Sheldon

15
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,950
"from the 23rd Century, and

16
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:51,720
"we have determined
that he is now ready

17
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:52,980
"to join us.

18
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,820
"His unique genius
is our best hope

19
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:57,860
(Penny:)for bringing peace
to a vast and troubled galaxy."

20
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,260
"I understand.

